+	//
+	// When set to P384, the NIST P-384 curve (also known as secp384r1) is used,
+	// providing 192-bit security.
+	//
+	// When set to P521, the NIST P-521 curve (also known as secp521r1) is used,
+	// providing 256-bit security.
